<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets 400 mln Dkr bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets 400 mln Dkr bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    02.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    AMS/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
